      "disposition": "The supplied predicate rejects the recorded dotted identifiers and foreign extensionless slash tokens while retaining file-shaped slash candidates without a repository foothold. resolve_task_inputs passes the task repository explicitly. The focused tests cover these distinctions."
    },
